      "text": "9 (Totally Normal!) Thoughts Every Pregnant Mom Has During the First Trimester"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 6,
      "heading_id": "heading_00001",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Key Takeaways"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 10,
      "heading_id": "heading_00002",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "1. Yay!"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 13,
      "heading_id": "heading_00003",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "2. Noooo!"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 16,
      "heading_id": "heading_00004",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3. Will I ever feel normal again?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 20,
      "heading_id": "heading_00005",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "4. How — seriously, how — am I going to make it through the rest of this pregnancy?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 23,
      "heading_id": "heading_00006",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "5. Is it okay if I catch a cold/work out/have spicy food/go to a haunted house?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 27,
      "heading_id": "heading_00007",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "6. Should I tell my friend/MIL/coworker? I’m the worst liar!"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 31,
      "heading_id": "heading_00008",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "7. I guess I’m just going to hide out for these 12 weeks and hope no one notices."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 33,
      "heading_id": "heading_00009",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "8. Is it too early to start decorating a nursery and buying onesies?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 35,
      "heading_id": "heading_00010",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "9. Second trimester, I have a lot of faith in you!"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 38,
      "heading_id": "heading_00011",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Updates history"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 42,
